abstract: >-
  Logical topology of Japan's bulk and 154 kV transmission network,
  structured from the one-line diagrams published by the ten Japanese
  transmission and distribution utilities. 1,351 nodes and 1,487 edges
  (active), each assertion carrying its source document and a confidence
  level, keyed by lifetime-stable UUIDs. The dataset holds no coordinates
  by design; positions are resolved through a crosswalk of external
  identifiers. Retired and corrected records are retained rather than
  deleted. Snapshot of 2026-08; diagram vintages are not uniform across
  utilities. Not reviewed by hand — the error rate is unmeasured.
